  "kind": "Business agent",
  "tagline": "Answers tickets from your docs and hands off to humans.",
  "description": "An example design for a customer-support agent: a chat widget, email and Slack in front of a single TypeScript agent on Claude, retrieval over help-center docs with Voyage embeddings and reranking on turbopuffer, Arcade connectors to the ticketing system, injection screening on untrusted input, per-action autonomy that hands refunds and unresolved tickets to a human, and evals on resolved tickets.",
